                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "7b6498c1-2185-33e1-b34e-4fd07e70fd49",
                        "entry_id": "8b2046a2-9218-3e58-a6b7-a22209a019b0",
                        "glosses": [
                            "draaimolen, carrousel"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "e687d0bc-405a-406f-9602-0089c9286957",
                                "sense_id": "7b6498c1-2185-33e1-b34e-4fd07e70fd49",
                                "text": "In vroegere jaren, toen de kermis nog in augustus plaatsvond, vermaakten mensen zich vooral in de mallemolen, de schommels, het Lunapark (de Shimmy) of bij de schietsalon, de Dikke Dame of de waarzegster."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "1aa0d88f-2b35-3e3a-8961-6d1589b0e0a4",
                        "entry_id": "8b2046a2-9218-3e58-a6b7-a22209a019b0",
                        "glosses": [
                            "de maalstroom van de wereld met al zijn opgewonden gekkigheid"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b806bd0f-453f-4c8c-b1ab-a2e2691e28ef",
                                "sense_id": "1aa0d88f-2b35-3e3a-8961-6d1589b0e0a4",
                                "text": "Dat er rechtszaken zouden volgen, was te verwachten. ‘Elke nieuwe regelgeving is het resultaat van een openbare hoorzitting, waarbij argumenten en feiten worden geëvalueerd en het publiek moet worden gehoord’, zegt milieuadvocaat David Pettit van de Natural Resources Defense Council. ‘Om regulering terug te schroeven, moet Trump door dezelfde juridische mallemolen. Heel wat milieuorganisaties, waaronder de onze, zullen Trumps decreet aanvechten. Die procedures kunnen maanden, zelfs jaren aanslepen.’"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e5909b6c-8368-4684-b739-559e858d7baf",
                                "sense_id": "1aa0d88f-2b35-3e3a-8961-6d1589b0e0a4",
                                "text": "Allereerst, die stunt van het LAKS was ongein, maar geen ‘nepnieuws’ zoals we dat kennen uit, bijvoorbeeld, de Amerikaanse verkiezingen. Het lijkt me verstandig het laatste etiket, dat toch al aan inflatie onderhevig is, te reserveren voor verzonnen nieuws over een ánder, een persoon of een organisatie, in de hoop op die manier de werkelijkheid te beïnvloeden - misschien zelfs de uitslag van verkiezingen. Die strategie zit dicht aan tegen de klassieke wapens van propaganda en desinformatie uit de Koude Oorlog, aangejaagd door de mallemolen van sociale media."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "5d4afc55-5fd2-4109-98e3-8224d491333a",
                        "source_entry_id": "8b2046a2-9218-3e58-a6b7-a22209a019b0",
                        "source_sense_id": "7b6498c1-2185-33e1-b34e-4fd07e70fd49",
                        "source_sense_description": "draaimolen, carrousel",
                        "target_lang_word": "merry-go-round",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "merry-go-round",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "53ec08e6-32f7-3028-b081-c161311f1520",
                                        "entry_id": "7f51e2e1-d5d7-31ab-99b6-4d600fee60c3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A carousel; a pleasure ride, typically found at fairs and amusement parks, consisting of a slowly revolving circular platform on which various seats are fixed, frequently shaped like horses or other animals."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9ee7574c-ed58-3cdb-87b6-ca3fe96a344c",
                                        "entry_id": "7f51e2e1-d5d7-31ab-99b6-4d600fee60c3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A piece of playground equipment consisting of a circular platform that is made to revolve by pushing while users stand on it."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "US"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fda51372-7601-3c79-91e3-76108dc673bf",
                                        "entry_id": "7f51e2e1-d5d7-31ab-99b6-4d600fee60c3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A meaningless cycle; a bustle of activity that gets nowhere."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "60b965d8-ea2c-4dbd-a45b-1bf1d657243f",
                                                "sense_id": "fda51372-7601-3c79-91e3-76108dc673bf",
                                                "text": "Some of us are lucky enough to still have families that care. But more often than not, we find that we have lost contact with the outside world, which leaves us very vulnerable in the merry-go-round of the parole process."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "760f32fc-36d6-4878-b01a-2eae49d9db5f",
                                                "sense_id": "fda51372-7601-3c79-91e3-76108dc673bf",
                                                "text": "There's no time for happiness today\nGot a date for lunch, a plastic tray\nGot a deal to sign her life away\nGot an early grave she's gotta make\nAnd we are all insane\nHold on\nSlow down\nYou'll never get to heaven on this merry-go-round […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a4e7c4da-7027-328d-98b4-44a6c13f142b",
                                        "entry_id": "7f51e2e1-d5d7-31ab-99b6-4d600fee60c3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A freight train of hopper wagons which loads and unloads its cargo while moving, a balloon loop being provided at power stations."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5ca3faff-1919-48a2-bca8-1ccc6a6ae4c7",
                                                "sense_id": "a4e7c4da-7027-328d-98b4-44a6c13f142b",
                                                "text": "Some of the desirable characteristics of the \"Merry-go-round\" railway described in this article are found in the Tyne Dock-Consett iron ore traffic of the N.E.R. The ore is carried in high capacity wagons, run in trains of fixed formation. A triangle at the Consett works enables each train, complete with its locomotive, to be turned and sent back without any remarshalling after unloading to Tyne Dock. At the quayside, the wagons are mechanically loaded as a train and at Consett they run directly on to a gantry above unloading bunkers; they have air-operated bottom-discharge doors worked from the locomotive."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b99b0f29-629c-4ed9-9abf-5b6842640999",
                                                "sense_id": "a4e7c4da-7027-328d-98b4-44a6c13f142b",
                                                "text": "Reshaping [of British Railways] initiated the development of what would become merry-go-round trains, delivering coal non-stop to power stations in newly built hopper wagons."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b8a21f35-16ac-3ff4-b4a3-557e1178ef08",
                                        "entry_id": "7f51e2e1-d5d7-31ab-99b6-4d600fee60c3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A series of singles and doubles that allow the batting team to score while still having runners on base who can be driven in by the next batter."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3181de71-7ccc-4165-b3f4-43759a9b09fe",
                                                "sense_id": "b8a21f35-16ac-3ff4-b4a3-557e1178ef08",
                                                "text": "Russell kept the merry-go-round moving with an RBI single that advanced Henderson to third."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "71ad4a0a-9ba7-3fa8-9235-ea1b28c1bde4",
                                        "entry_id": "7f51e2e1-d5d7-31ab-99b6-4d600fee60c3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A cooperative scheme in which members regularly contribute money to a pool, and the collected money is then paid out to one of the members, repeating so that every member has eventually received the collected money."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Kenya"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
